# --- Spreadsheets: PRECAUTION (added 03.11.2026) ----------------------------
# BM+ tracker exports contain client data and must never be committed.
# Every spreadsheet is ignored for now. When MART gets its own templates,
# do NOT delete this block: add an exception for the templates folder only,
# e.g.
#   !templates/**/*.xlsx
# so real tracker exports stay blocked everywhere else.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.csv
# Excel lock files ("~$Book.xlsx")
~$*

# --- Build output, caches, local data --------------------------------------
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.db
*.db.gz
